    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d583">

                <pb facs="1010" n="876" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv01/pg876"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">761.94/7–2145: Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 583<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Japanese Minister of Foreign
                        Affairs</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Togo</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Japanese
                        Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Togo</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">very secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">urgent</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-07-12T02:20:00+09:00">July 12, 1945—2:20 a.m.</date> [<hi
                            rendition="#italic">sic</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>894. Re my telegram No. 893.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d583-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>When you convey this matter to them, please make it understood that the subject
                    should be treated as absolutely secret. I realize that I am being presumptuous
                    in saying this; I mention it merely to be sure.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
